const romanPairs = [[1000,'M'],[900,'CM'],[500,'D'],[400,'CD'],[100,'C'],[90,'XC'],[50,'L'],[40,'XL'],[10,'X'],[9,'IX'],[5,'V'],[4,'IV'],[1,'I']];
const roman = n => { if (!Number.isInteger(n) || n < 1 || n > 3999) return null; let out=''; for(const [v,s] of romanPairs) while(n>=v){out+=s;n-=v} return out };
const arabic = s => { s=s.toUpperCase(); if(!/^[IVXLCDM]+$/.test(s)) return null; let total=0,last=0; for(let i=s.length-1;i>=0;i--){const v={I:1,V:5,X:10,L:50,C:100,D:500,M:1000}[s[i]]; total+=v<last?-v:v;last=Math.max(last,v)} return roman(total)===s?total:null };
let mode='arabic', tokens=[], current='', lastAnswer=0, score=0;
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s), keypad=$('#keypad'), display=$('#display'), expression=$('#expression'), message=$('#message');
function labels(){return mode==='arabic'?['7','8','9','÷','4','5','6','×','1','2','3','−','0','C','⌫','+','=']:['VII','VIII','IX','÷','IV','V','VI','×','I','II','III','−','C','⌫','+','=']}
function renderKeys(){keypad.innerHTML='';labels().forEach(v=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='key '+(['÷','×','−','+'].includes(v)?'operator ':'')+(v==='C'||v==='⌫'?'action ':'')+(v==='='?'equals ':'')+(v==='0'?'zero ':'');b.textContent=v;b.setAttribute('aria-label',v);b.onclick=()=>press(v);keypad.append(b)})}
function parseCurrent(){return mode==='arabic'?(current===''?0:Number(current)):arabic(current)}
function shown(n){return mode==='roman'?roman(n)||'—':String(n)}
function update(){const p=parseCurrent();display.textContent=current===''?(tokens.length?shown(tokens[tokens.length-1]):'0'):(mode==='roman'&&p===null?current:shown(p));expression.textContent=tokens.map(t=>typeof t==='number'?shown(t):t).join(' ')||'พร้อมคำนวณ'}
function addDigit(x){if(mode==='arabic'){ if(current.length<8) current+=x; }else{const candidate=current+x; if(candidate.length<=15)current=candidate;} update()}
function press(x){message.textContent='';if(x==='C'){tokens=[];current='';update();return}if(x==='⌫'){current=current.slice(0,-1);update();return}if(x==='='){calculate();return}if(['+','−','×','÷'].includes(x)){const n=parseCurrent();if(n===null){message.textContent='รูปแบบเลขโรมันยังไม่ถูกต้อง ลองเช่น IV หรือ XLVII';return}if(current!==''){tokens.push(n);current=''}if(tokens.length&&typeof tokens[tokens.length-1]==='string')tokens[tokens.length-1]=x;else if(tokens.length)tokens.push(x);update();return}addDigit(x)}
function calculate(){const n=parseCurrent();if(n===null){message.textContent='เลขโรมันนี้ยังเขียนไม่ถูกนะ ลองใหม่อีกครั้ง';return}if(current!=='')tokens.push(n);if(tokens.length<3){update();return}let value=tokens[0];for(let i=1;i<tokens.length;i+=2){const op=tokens[i], next=tokens[i+1];if(typeof next!=='number')break; value=op==='+'?value+next:op==='−'?value-next:op==='×'?value*next:value/next}if(!Number.isInteger(value)||value<1||value>3999){message.textContent='ผลลัพธ์ต้องเป็นจำนวนเต็ม 1–3999 เพื่อแสดงเป็นเลขโรมัน';tokens=[];current='';update();return}expression.textContent=tokens.map(t=>typeof t==='number'?shown(t):t).join(' ')+' =';tokens=[];current=mode==='arabic'?String(value):roman(value);update()}
function setMode(next){const value=parseCurrent();mode=next;document.querySelectorAll('.mode').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.mode===mode));$('#modeLabel').textContent=mode==='arabic'?'โหมดอารบิก':'โหมดโรมัน';$('#hint').textContent=mode==='arabic'?'ใช้แป้นพิมพ์ 0–9 ได้เลย':'ใช้ I, V, X, L, C, D, M จากแป้นพิมพ์ได้เลย';if(value!==null&&value>0)current=mode==='arabic'?String(value):roman(value);else current='';tokens=[];renderKeys();update()}
document.querySelectorAll('.mode').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setMode(b.dataset.mode));
function newQuestion(){lastAnswer=Math.floor(Math.random()*98)+2;$('#question').textContent=mode==='arabic'?lastAnswer:roman(lastAnswer);$('#questionText').textContent=mode==='arabic'?'พิมพ์เป็นเลขโรมัน แล้วกดตรวจคำตอบ':'พิมพ์เป็นเลขอารบิก แล้วกดตรวจคำตอบ';$('#answer').value='';$('#feedback').textContent=''}
function check(){const raw=$('#answer').value.trim();const got=mode==='arabic'?arabic(raw):Number(raw);const feedback=$('#feedback');if(got===lastAnswer){score++;$('#score').textContent=score;feedback.textContent='เก่งมาก! คำตอบถูกต้อง';feedback.className='feedback good';setTimeout(newQuestion,800)}else{const answer=mode==='arabic'?roman(lastAnswer):lastAnswer;feedback.textContent=`ยังไม่ใช่ ลองอีกครั้งนะ (คำตอบคือ ${answer})`;feedback.className='feedback bad'}}
$('#check').onclick=check;$('#newQuestion').onclick=newQuestion;$('#answer').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')check()});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(document.activeElement===$('#answer'))return;if(e.key==='Escape')press('C');if(e.key==='Enter')press('=');if(mode==='arabic'&&/^[0-9]$/.test(e.key))addDigit(e.key);if(mode==='roman'&&/^[ivxlcdm]$/i.test(e.key))addDigit(e.key.toUpperCase());const map={'/':'÷','*':'×','-':'−','+':'+'};if(map[e.key])press(map[e.key]);if(e.key==='Backspace')press('⌫')});
renderKeys();update();newQuestion();
